    {
      "heading": "Long vowel mark ー (chōonpu)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "paragraphs": [
            "In katakana, a long vowel is written with a horizontal bar ー (vertical in vertical writing). It lengthens the previous vowel by one full beat."
          ]
        },
        {
